---
description: ADLC Agent Atlas is an optional observer; it does not orchestrate agents.
alwaysApply: false
---

Atlas only observes Claude Code + ADLC runs. Do not run an observatory preflight,
create an architect or extra subagents, or require `observatory:verify` because of
this repository. See `AGENTS.md`. The retired orchestration contract is archived
in `docs/legacy/` and is not active.
